<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>Functions in Real Life — maximizing the area of a fenced plot</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>A farmer has {@perimeter@} metres of fencing to enclose a rectangular plot against an existing straight wall. Only three sides need fencing: two equal widths \(w\) at right angles to the wall, and one length opposite the wall.</p>
<p>The area enclosed, in square metres, as a function of the width \(w\) metres, is</p>
<p>\[ A(w) = w({@perimeter@}-2w). \]</p>
<p>Find the <strong>maximum possible area</strong>, in square metres.</p>
<div>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] \(\mathrm{m}^2\)</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>\(A(w) = w({@perimeter@}-2w) = {@Aexpand@}\) is a quadratic function of \(w\). The coefficient of \(w^2\) is negative, so its graph is a downward-opening parabola, and the <strong>maximum value is at the vertex</strong>.</p>
<p>The parabola crosses the \(w\)-axis at \(w = 0\) and \(w = {@perimeter/2@}\). By symmetry, the vertex is halfway between them, at \(w = {@wvertex@}\). (Equivalently, \(w = -\dfrac{b}{2a} = -\dfrac{ {@perimeter@} }{2\times(-2)} = {@wvertex@}\).)</p>
<p>That is the width that gives the maximum. To find the maximum <strong>area</strong> itself, substitute it back into \(A(w)\):</p>
\[ A({@wvertex@}) = {@wvertex@}\times({@perimeter@}-2\times{@wvertex@}) = {@wvertex@}\times{@perimeter-2*wvertex@} = {@ta@}\ \mathrm{m}^2. \]
<p>The best plot is \({@wvertex@}\,\mathrm{m}\) wide and \({@perimeter-2*wvertex@}\,\mathrm{m}\) long.</p>
<div style="text-align:center;" role="img" aria-label="Graph of area A against width w: a downward parabola from w = 0 to w = half the fencing, with its highest point marked at the vertex.">
[[jsxgraph width="360px" height="240px"]]
(function() {
  var P = {#perimeter#}, wv = {#wvertex#}, Am = {#ta#};
  var b = JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(divid, {
    boundingbox: [-0.12*P/2, 1.2*Am, 1.08*P/2, -0.12*Am], axis: true, grid: false,
    showNavigation: false, showCopyright: false
  });
  b.create('functiongraph', [function(w){ return w*(P - 2*w); }, 0, P/2], {strokeColor:'#003399', strokeWidth:2});
  b.create('segment', [[wv, 0], [wv, Am]], {strokeColor:'#888888', dash:2, fixed:true});
  b.create('point', [wv, Am], {size:4, color:'#cc0000', fixed:true, name:'(' + wv + ', ' + Am + ')', label:{offset:[10,8], anchorX:'left'}});
  b.create('text', [1.07*P/2, 0.07*Am, 'w'], {anchorX:'right', fixed:true});
  b.create('text', [0.02*P/2, 1.12*Am, 'A'], {fixed:true});
})();
[[/jsxgraph]]
</div>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
